# =============================================================================
# Line-ending policy for the files whose BYTES matter.
#
# web/index.html is embedded into the firmware byte-for-byte
# (board_build.embed_files -> objcopy), and its SHA-256 is part of the verified
# API/Web contract. core.autocrlf would otherwise check it out as CRLF on Windows
# and change the embedded page. Pinning it to LF keeps every clone identical.
#
# Everything else keeps the Git-for-Windows default (CRLF in the working tree,
# LF in the repository), which does not affect the compiled output.
# =============================================================================
web/index.html text eol=lf

# Binary assets are never line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.ppm binary
